"nginx: enable the real_ip module with set_real_ip_from for your proxy and "
"real_ip_header X-Forwarded-For."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Moderation/SafeguardService.php:739
msgid ""
"Apache: enable mod_remoteip with RemoteIPHeader X-Forwarded-For and "
